     1|/**
     2| * IVX IA Brain Memory — durable user-profile memory (Supabase-backed).
     3| *
     4| * IVX IA must remember WHO it is talking to across conversations, app reloads,
     5| * and Render restarts: the owner name, company, user names, roles, language and
     6| * preferred greeting. This is persisted in the same durable Supabase document
     7| * store the rest of the platform uses (survives deploy/restart on any tier — no
     8| * paid disk required), NOT in local app state.
     9| *
    10| * HARD HONESTY / PRIVACY RULE (platform-wide):
    11| *   - Only data the user explicitly asks IVX IA to remember is stored.
    12| *   - No sensitive data (passwords, tokens, payment, government IDs) is ever
    13| *     stored here, even if a command tries to — those values are rejected.
    14| *
    15| * Default identity (seeded once, owner profile):
    16| *   AI name:   IVX IA
